{"seq":1,"slug":"npm-ecosystem","title":"npm 生态系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/npm-ecosystem","wordCount":860,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"npm-生态系统\">npm 生态系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>npm 是&quot;Node 包管理器&quot;的缩写，但它实际上是三个组件协作的生态系统，加上一套依赖解析规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三大组件</strong>：Registry（包存储中心）、CLI（命令行工具）、Website（Web 界面与组织管理）。</li>\n<li><strong>包管理器选择</strong>：npm、yarn、pnpm 的差异集中在安装速度、磁盘占用和幽灵依赖防护三点上。</li>\n<li><strong>扁平化与幽灵依赖</strong>：npm v3+ 把子依赖提升到 node_modules 根目录以解决路径过长问题，代价是项目可以 require 未声明的包。</li>\n<li><strong>Lockfile</strong>：记录依赖树的精确版本与完整性哈希，必须提交版本控制；CI 环境用 <code>npm ci</code> 严格按 lockfile 安装。</li>\n<li><strong>供应链安全</strong>：<code>npm audit</code> 检查已知漏洞，<code>overrides</code> 强制修复嵌套依赖版本，<code>.npmrc</code> 配置私有 Registry。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"npm-三大组件\">npm 三大组件</h2><p>npm 不仅仅是一个命令行工具，它是由三个紧密协作的组件组成的完整生态系统：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph npm 生态系统&#10;        REGISTRY[npm Registry&lt;br/&gt;包注册中心&lt;br/&gt;registry.npmjs.org]&#10;        CLI[npm CLI&lt;br/&gt;命令行工具&lt;br/&gt;npm install / publish]&#10;        WEB[npmjs.com&lt;br/&gt;Web 界面&lt;br/&gt;搜索、文档、管理]&#10;    end&#10;    DEV[开发者] --&gt; CLI&#10;    DEV --&gt; WEB&#10;    CLI --&gt; REGISTRY&#10;    WEB --&gt; REGISTRY\">graph TB\n    subgraph npm 生态系统\n        REGISTRY[npm Registry&lt;br/&gt;包注册中心&lt;br/&gt;registry.npmjs.org]\n        CLI[npm CLI&lt;br/&gt;命令行工具&lt;br/&gt;npm install / publish]\n        WEB[npmjs.com&lt;br/&gt;Web 界面&lt;br/&gt;搜索、文档、管理]\n    end\n    DEV[开发者] --&gt; CLI\n    DEV --&gt; WEB\n    CLI --&gt; REGISTRY\n    WEB --&gt; REGISTRY</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Registry</td>\n<td>包存储中心</td>\n<td>存储所有公开和私有的 npm 包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>命令行工具</td>\n<td>安装、发布、管理包的主要工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Website</td>\n<td>Web 界面</td>\n<td>浏览包文档、搜索包、管理组织和令牌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"包管理器对比\">包管理器对比</h2><p>目前 Node.js 生态中有三个主流的包管理器：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph npm&#10;        NPM_NM[node_modules&lt;br/&gt;扁平化结构]&#10;        NPM_LOCK[package-lock.json]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph yarn&#10;        YARN_NM[node_modules&lt;br/&gt;扁平化 + PnP]&#10;        YARN_LOCK[yarn.lock]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph pnpm&#10;        PNPM_STORE[全局内容寻址存储]&#10;        PNPM_NM[node_modules&lt;br/&gt;硬链接 + 符号链接]&#10;        PNPM_LOCK[pnpm-lock.yaml]&#10;        PNPM_STORE --&gt; PNPM_NM&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph npm\n        NPM_NM[node_modules&lt;br/&gt;扁平化结构]\n        NPM_LOCK[package-lock.json]\n    end\n    subgraph yarn\n        YARN_NM[node_modules&lt;br/&gt;扁平化 + PnP]\n        YARN_LOCK[yarn.lock]\n    end\n    subgraph pnpm\n        PNPM_STORE[全局内容寻址存储]\n        PNPM_NM[node_modules&lt;br/&gt;硬链接 + 符号链接]\n        PNPM_LOCK[pnpm-lock.yaml]\n        PNPM_STORE --&gt; PNPM_NM\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>npm</th>\n<th>yarn (v4)</th>\n<th>pnpm</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>安装速度</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘占用</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>最低（共享存储）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幽灵依赖</td>\n<td>存在</td>\n<td>存在</td>\n<td>严格隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Monorepo 支持</td>\n<td>workspaces</td>\n<td>workspaces</td>\n<td>workspaces（最佳）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lockfile</td>\n<td>package-lock.json</td>\n<td>yarn.lock</td>\n<td>pnpm-lock.yaml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node.js 内置</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>需安装</td>\n<td>需安装</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖解析与-node_modules\">依赖解析与 node_modules</h2><h3 id=\"npm-的扁平化策略\">npm 的扁平化策略</h3><p>npm v3 之前使用嵌套结构，导致 Windows 上路径过长的问题。npm v3+ 采用扁平化（hoisting）策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;npm v2 嵌套结构&quot;&#10;        ROOT1[node_modules/]&#10;        A1[&quot;A@1.0&quot;] --&gt; ROOT1&#10;        A1_DEP[&quot;node_modules/B@1.0&quot;] --&gt; A1&#10;        C1[&quot;C@1.0&quot;] --&gt; ROOT1&#10;        C1_DEP[&quot;node_modules/B@2.0&quot;] --&gt; C1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;npm v3+ 扁平化结构&quot;&#10;        ROOT2[node_modules/]&#10;        A2[&quot;A@1.0&quot;] --&gt; ROOT2&#10;        B2[&quot;B@1.0&quot;] --&gt; ROOT2&#10;        C2[&quot;C@1.0&quot;] --&gt; ROOT2&#10;        C2_DEP[&quot;C/node_modules/B@2.0&quot;] --&gt; C2&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"npm v2 嵌套结构\"\n        ROOT1[node_modules/]\n        A1[\"A@1.0\"] --&gt; ROOT1\n        A1_DEP[\"node_modules/B@1.0\"] --&gt; A1\n        C1[\"C@1.0\"] --&gt; ROOT1\n        C1_DEP[\"node_modules/B@2.0\"] --&gt; C1\n    end\n    subgraph \"npm v3+ 扁平化结构\"\n        ROOT2[node_modules/]\n        A2[\"A@1.0\"] --&gt; ROOT2\n        B2[\"B@1.0\"] --&gt; ROOT2\n        C2[\"C@1.0\"] --&gt; ROOT2\n        C2_DEP[\"C/node_modules/B@2.0\"] --&gt; C2\n    end</pre><p>扁平化解决了路径过长的问题，但引入了<strong>幽灵依赖</strong>问题——项目可以 require 没有在 package.json 中声明的包（因为它被提升到了 node_modules 根目录）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幽灵依赖示例\">幽灵依赖示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import lodash from &#39;lodash&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lodash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lodash'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果 lodash 只是某个依赖包的子依赖，但被 npm 提升到了顶层，上面的 import 会正常工作。但当依赖结构变化时（比如那个依赖包升级了不再使用 lodash），代码就会突然崩溃。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常用-npm-命令\">常用 npm 命令</h2><h3 id=\"安装依赖\">安装依赖</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install&#10;npm install express&#10;npm install -D typescript @types/node&#10;npm install -g tsx\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> express</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> typescript</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @types/node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tsx</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"依赖类型\">依赖类型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const dependencyTypes = {&#10;  dependencies: &#39;运行时依赖（生产环境需要）&#39;,&#10;  devDependencies: &#39;开发时依赖（构建、测试、lint 等工具）&#39;,&#10;  peerDependencies: &#39;对等依赖（插件机制，宿主环境提供）&#39;,&#10;  optionalDependencies: &#39;可选依赖（安装失败不会中断流程）&#39;,&#10;  bundleDependencies: &#39;打包依赖（发布时一起打包的依赖）&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dependencyTypes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dependencies: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'运行时依赖（生产环境需要）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  devDependencies: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'开发时依赖（构建、测试、lint 等工具）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  peerDependencies: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'对等依赖（插件机制，宿主环境提供）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  optionalDependencies: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'可选依赖（安装失败不会中断流程）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bundleDependencies: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'打包依赖（发布时一起打包的依赖）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"脚本命令\">脚本命令</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm run dev&#10;npm test&#10;npm run build&#10;npm run lint&#10;npx tsx script.ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tsx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script.ts</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>npx</code> 会在本地 node_modules/.bin 中查找可执行文件，找不到则临时下载执行。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"lockfile-的作用\">Lockfile 的作用</h2><p>Lockfile（如 package-lock.json）记录了依赖树中每个包的精确版本和下载地址，确保在不同环境中安装完全相同的依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-app&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;lockfileVersion&quot;: 3,&#10;  &quot;packages&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;node_modules/express&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;version&quot;: &quot;4.18.2&quot;,&#10;      &quot;resolved&quot;: &quot;https://registry.npmjs.org/express/-/express-4.18.2.tgz&quot;,&#10;      &quot;integrity&quot;: &quot;sha512-...&quot;,&#10;      &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;accepts&quot;: &quot;~1.3.8&quot;,&#10;        &quot;body-parser&quot;: &quot;1.20.1&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lockfileVersion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"packages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"node_modules/express\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4.18.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"resolved\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://registry.npmjs.org/express/-/express-4.18.2.tgz\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"integrity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha512-...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"accepts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"~1.3.8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"body-parser\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.20.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Lockfile 必须提交到版本控制</strong>，确保团队成员和 CI 安装一致的依赖</li>\n<li>使用 <code>npm ci</code> 在 CI 环境中安装，它严格按照 lockfile 安装，速度更快且更可靠</li>\n<li>不要手动编辑 lockfile</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"npm-安全审计\">npm 安全审计</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm audit&#10;npm audit fix&#10;npm audit fix --force\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> audit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> audit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> audit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface AuditResult {&#10;  severity: &#39;info&#39; | &#39;low&#39; | &#39;moderate&#39; | &#39;high&#39; | &#39;critical&#39;;&#10;  title: string;&#10;  package: string;&#10;  patchedVersions: string;&#10;  recommendation: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const securityPractices = {&#10;  定期审计: &#39;npm audit 检查已知漏洞&#39;,&#10;  &#39;使用 lockfile&#39;: &#39;锁定精确版本避免供应链攻击&#39;,&#10;  最小化依赖: &#39;减少依赖数量降低攻击面&#39;,&#10;  检查下载量: &#39;优先使用社区验证的高下载量包&#39;,&#10;  审查新依赖: &#39;安装前查看包的维护状态和代码&#39;,&#10;  &#39;使用 overrides&#39;: &#39;强制修复嵌套依赖的漏洞版本&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AuditResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  severity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'info'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'moderate'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'critical'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  package</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  patchedVersions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  recommendation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> securityPractices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  定期审计: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'npm audit 检查已知漏洞'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '使用 lockfile'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'锁定精确版本避免供应链攻击'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  最小化依赖: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'减少依赖数量降低攻击面'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  检查下载量: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'优先使用社区验证的高下载量包'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  审查新依赖: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'安装前查看包的维护状态和代码'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '使用 overrides'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'强制修复嵌套依赖的漏洞版本'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"私有-registry\">私有 Registry</h2><p>企业环境中常需要搭建私有 npm Registry：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm config set registry https://registry.company.com/&#10;npm login --registry=https://registry.company.com/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://registry.company.com/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --registry=https://registry.company.com/</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const registryOptions = {&#10;  Verdaccio: &#39;轻量级私有 Registry，开源免费&#39;,&#10;  &#39;GitHub Packages&#39;: &#39;与 GitHub 集成的包托管&#39;,&#10;  &#39;GitLab Package Registry&#39;: &#39;与 GitLab 集成的包托管&#39;,&#10;  &#39;AWS CodeArtifact&#39;: &#39;AWS 托管的包仓库服务&#39;,&#10;  Artifactory: &#39;企业级包管理平台&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> registryOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  Verdaccio: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'轻量级私有 Registry，开源免费'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'GitHub Packages'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'与 GitHub 集成的包托管'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'GitLab Package Registry'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'与 GitLab 集成的包托管'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'AWS CodeArtifact'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AWS 托管的包仓库服务'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  Artifactory: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'企业级包管理平台'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>可以在 <code>.npmrc</code> 中配置不同 scope 使用不同的 Registry：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"@company:registry=https://registry.company.com/&#10;//registry.company.com/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@company:registry=https://registry.company.com/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//registry.company.com/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>npm 生态由 Registry（包存储）、CLI（命令行）和 Website（Web 界面）三部分组成。</li>\n<li>npm、yarn、pnpm 是三大主流包管理器，pnpm 在磁盘效率和幽灵依赖防护方面表现最佳。</li>\n<li>npm 的扁平化策略解决了路径过长问题，但引入了幽灵依赖风险。</li>\n<li>Lockfile 必须提交到版本控制，CI 环境应使用 <code>npm ci</code> 安装。</li>\n<li>定期执行 <code>npm audit</code> 进行安全审计，使用 <code>.npmrc</code> 配置私有 Registry。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"npm 生态系统","id":"npm-生态系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"npm 三大组件","id":"npm-三大组件"},{"level":2,"text":"包管理器对比","id":"包管理器对比"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖解析与 node_modules","id":"依赖解析与-node_modules"},{"level":3,"text":"npm 的扁平化策略","id":"npm-的扁平化策略"},{"level":3,"text":"幽灵依赖示例","id":"幽灵依赖示例"},{"level":2,"text":"常用 npm 命令","id":"常用-npm-命令"},{"level":3,"text":"安装依赖","id":"安装依赖"},{"level":3,"text":"依赖类型","id":"依赖类型"},{"level":3,"text":"脚本命令","id":"脚本命令"},{"level":2,"text":"Lockfile 的作用","id":"lockfile-的作用"},{"level":2,"text":"npm 安全审计","id":"npm-安全审计"},{"level":2,"text":"私有 Registry","id":"私有-registry"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Stream 与 Buffer","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/async-programming/streams-and-buffers"},"next":{"title":"深入 package.json","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/package-json-in-depth"}}